# Density Compare
# Erbium (Er) — real density 9.066 g/cm³. equal masses: Erbium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Erbium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.6mm color: #94d9ff at (-20mm, 4.8mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 72.3 g — the water cube is the reference
